Output docs/assets/01-shape.gif

Require node

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 620
Set Padding 18
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#111827"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 8
Set TypingSpeed 30 ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts shape:intro"
Enter
Wait+Screen /lower tiers publish/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts shape:contracts"
Enter
Wait+Screen /nothing here calls a provider/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts shape:plan"
Enter
Wait+Screen /total: 48 resources/
Sleep 6 s

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "node demo/views.ts shape:code"
Enter
Wait+Screen /full walkthrough/
Sleep 9 s
